- 0.80–0.94: Very strong utility. Near-direct evidence with high interpretability
  and transferability and only minor limitations.
- 0.95–1.00: Exceptional utility. Direct evidence of the target property under
  closely aligned conditions; reserve this range for unusually strong evidence.

Choose the band first and then the hundredth. Missing or unreported metadata is
